
CFortune V1.1

From the file written by George Kerber

C-Net Amiga conversions by Ronald Kushner
--------------
How to install:

Place the fortunes file in the System: directory 

Place the Cfortune in your PFiles directory...

Add this in your system:sys.welcome file:

\n1\#2Pfiles:CFortune\n1

or if you prefer a fortune at EACH and EVERY main prompt edit line 
# 19(18 on some text editors) of BBSTEXT to:

\n1\#2Pfiles:CFortune\\n1\c3Main: \q1 

ENJOY!!!
